# Cloudflare Pages reads this file the way Netlify reads netlify.toml.
# Static files win first; these rules only run when nothing on disk matches.

# projects.html was retired: what it claimed, the archive now proves, and the
# funding and governance paragraphs moved to About.
/projects.html  /about.html  301
/projects       /about.html  301

# A path matching nothing renders the styled 404 page. Cloudflare handles that
# through not_found_handling in wrangler.jsonc, because a 404 status is not
# valid in this file: only 200, 301, 302, 303, 307 and 308 are accepted.
